<p>If Twist Fate is not on cooldown minor anomalies will be held for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">1, 2, 3, 5, 6</acronym> turns, allowing your spell to cast as normal.  While held you may cast Twist Fate in order to trigger the anomaly and may choose the target area.</p><p>If a second anomaly occurs while a prior one is held or the timed effect expires the first anomaly will trigger immediately, interrupting your current turn or action.</p><p>Paradox reductions from held anomalies occur when triggered.</p><p></p><p>Current Anomaly: None</p><p></p><p></p>